GRF_JP_BADGES:{WHITE}No {YELLOW}JP+ Badges{WHITE} is found.{}It is essential for JP+ Private Companies. Please download it from Online Content manager.
GRF_TKMS:{WHITE}Please remove {YELLOW}Tokyo Metro Set{WHITE} to avoid duplicates.{}JP+ Private Companies contains every vehicle of it.
GRF_TIAS:{WHITE}Please remove {YELLOW}TOEI interconnection set (TIAS){WHITE} to avoid duplicates.{}JP+ Private Companies contains every vehicle of it.
GRF_JPTRACKS:{WHITE}Please use {YELLOW}JP+ Tracks {WHITE}or {YELLOW}any other grf that adds metro and narrow tracks {WHITE}for the best game experience.

